{"id":12795,"author":"scolton","body":"UPDATE: Because of \u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/Awesomerp\"\u003eAwesomerp\u003c/a\u003e's request, I made a\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"http://valdeon.co/toaster\"\u003ewebsite\u003c/a\u003e!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIn the midst of all of the argument about new rules, new gamemodes, and staff applications, I'd like to present this thread, dedicated to toasters.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhile being at home sick this morning, I realized that I hadn't used our new toaster. \u0026nbsp;It holds 4 slices of bread and is also a convection oven. \u0026nbsp;It made the best toast I have ever had.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/QRmg32f.jpg\u0026quot;\"\u003e","body_tagged":"UPDATE: Because of \u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/Awesomerp\"\u003eAwesomerp\u003c/a\u003e's request, I made a\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"http://valdeon.co/toaster\"\u003ewebsite\u003c/a\u003e!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIn the midst of all of the argument about new rules, new gamemodes, and staff applications, I'd like to present this thread, dedicated to toasters.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhile being at home sick this morning, I realized that I hadn't used our new toaster. \u0026nbsp;It holds 4 slices of bread and is also a convection oven. \u0026nbsp;It made the best toast I have ever had.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/QRmg32f.jpg\u0026quot;\"\u003e","created_at":1429625477,"title":"Toaster Appreciation Thread","replies":[{"id":180094,"author":"ClubberNugget","body":"I bet that toaster can cure any disease","body_tagged":"I bet that toaster can cure any disease","created_at":1429625731},{"id":180095,"author":"zero9178","body":"That's why I love you so much. \u0026nbsp;Lol","body_tagged":"That's why I love you so much. \u0026nbsp;Lol","created_at":1429625832},{"id":180101,"author":"Rainstruck","body":"Does anyone else remember the Brave Little Toaster Movies.","body